{"articleNo":"112272","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=112272&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]\"생활관생 가족 식사 체험\"행사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.08.29","hit":"3008","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2014학년도 2학기 입사 등록 기간에 생활관을 방문하시는 생활관생 가족 분들께</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">생활관 편의 시설 관람 및 식사기회를 제공하고자&nbsp;하오니 많은 이용 바랍니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%; TEXT-INDENT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>1. 일&nbsp; 시</strong> : <strong>2014. 8. 30(토) ~ 8. 31(일), 각 관 식사시간</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 푸름관 : 8.30(토) 석식, 8.31(일) 중식/석식 제공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 오름관 : 8.30(토) 석식, 8.31(일) 조식/석식 제공</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp; 2. 방&nbsp; 법</strong> : 관생과 함께 각 관 식사시간에 식당을 방문하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">자유롭게 식사</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 220%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2014. 8. 29.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 0.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교생활관</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
